.TH MAGUS-MAN 1 "" "magus" "magus Manual"
.SH NAME
magus\-man \- Install the man pages embedded in this binary
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B magus
.RI "man install [\-\-dir <path>]"
.SH DESCRIPTION
Write the complete magus manpage set carried by this binary. The installer uses this command to place the pages under the selected installation prefix.
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.RS
.TP
\fBinstall\fR
Write the embedded section 1 man pages
.RE
.SH EXAMPLES
\fIInstall to the default user manpath\fR
.PP
.EX
magus man install
.EE
.PP
\fIInstall to a custom prefix\fR
.PP
.EX
magus man install --dir ~/.local/share/man/man1
.EE
.PP
